flowchart TD
  A[Sources and registries] --> B[Immutable manifest + lockfiles]
  B --> C[Isolated build runner]
  C --> D[SBOM + AI artifact inventory]
  D --> E[Digest verification]
  E --> F[Signature identity verification]
  F --> G[Provenance attestation verification]
  G --> H[License + vulnerability policy]
  H -->|All pass| I[Signed release manifest]
